      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Bilateral Kienböck's disease in pediatrics is extremely rare. We report a case of a 14-year-old boy with bilateral pediatric Kienböck's disease who was treated by temporary scaphotrapeziotrapezoidal joint fixation, with a good clinical result and radiographic results."},
